8. Convert List to Set (Remove Duplicates)

import java.util.*;

public class ListToSet {
public static void main(String[] args) {
List<String> names = Arrays.asList("John", "Jane", "John", "Alice");

Set<String> uniqueNames = new HashSet<>(names);
System.out.println("Unique Names: " + uniqueNames);
}
}

Output:

Unique Names: [Alice, Jane, John]
